        {
          "text": "So how is an LLM made?",
          "from": 10,
          "to": 61
        },
        {
          "text": "In three steps.",
          "from": 67,
          "to": 106
        },
        {
          "text": "Pre-training, where it reads trillions",
          "from": 109,
          "to": 172
        },
        {
          "text": "of words and learns language",
          "from": 173,
          "to": 222
        },
        {
          "text": "and facts.",
          "from": 223,
          "to": 260
        },
        {
          "text": "Fine-tuning, where it studies good",
          "from": 264,
          "to": 315
        },
        {
          "text": "questions and answers,",
          "from": 317,
          "to": 359
        },
        {
          "text": "so it learns to follow instructions.",
          "from": 361,
          "to": 435
        },
        {
          "text": "And human feedback,",
          "from": 438,
          "to": 475
        },
        {
          "text": "where people rate its answers,",
